  "schema": "arcpuzzles-parametric-prototype-evidence-v1",
  "scope": "# Review: 57bafcdde8c3 \u2014 proposed parametric authoring\n\nTask `57bafcdde8c3`; approved production v3.0.0 / rule `e47ef90b42c0` remains byte-identical.\nAdded two task-local executable prototypes, focused tests, public/private exporters and replay evidence.\nComponents: six threshold/connectivity settings; the default Racket program is exactly canonical.\nPublic-evaluation inspiration `edb79dae`: template replacement with one-step or terminal legend mapping.\nChecks: 20 focused tests; 16 retained episodes, 64 distinct-within-episode queries and 108 Racket-checked labeled pairs.\nThe public source's two demonstrations fit both mapping policies; their visible-query predictions differ in 88 cells.\nBoth supplementary tickets completed within their bounded probe scope; no peer safety finding.\nNo production generator, canonical labels, approval records or shared workflow source changed.\nDisposition: useful proposed authoring work; owner qualification and exact-source acceptance remain separate.\n",
